{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fin.VecNotation","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.no_mixed_sign_at_total_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.no_mixed_sign_at_total_two","kind":"theorem","line":290,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/SignCoherentTwist.lean#L290-L300","doc":"**No mixed-sign assignment reaches total `2`.**  This is why `u` needs no\ncoherence hypothesis: the alternative coherence would have excluded does not\nexist, where for `d` it does (`d_mixed_sign_not_coherent`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.u_multiset_forced","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.u_multiset_forced","kind":"theorem","line":273,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/SignCoherentTwist.lean#L273-L288","doc":"**`u = {0,1,1}` is forced by range and total alone.**\n\nNote the hypotheses: unlike `d_multiset_forced` this takes **no**\n`SignCoherent` argument. With entries in `{−1,0,1}` summing to `2` the multiset\nis `{0,1,1}` in one of its three orderings, because two entries must be `1` and\nthe remainder is then `0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.no_negative_of_positive_total","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.no_negative_of_positive_total","kind":"theorem","line":253,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/SignCoherentTwist.lean#L253-L271","doc":"Sign-coherence plus a **positive** total forbids any negative strand — the\nmirror of `no_positive_of_negative_total`, recorded for the general positive\ncase even though `u` below does not need it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.cancel_preserves_total","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.cancel_preserves_total","kind":"theorem","line":219,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/SignCoherentTwist.lean#L219-L224","doc":"**Cancellation preserves the total.**  Moving one unit off a positive strand\nonto a negative one — the reduction step — leaves `Σ t` fixed, so it leaves\n`Q_twist = T/3`, `Y`, and the `ℤ₆` layer fixed too. Reduction is therefore\ninvisible to every constraint the battery imposes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.nu_forms_same_weight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.nu_forms_same_weight","kind":"theorem","line":213,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/SignCoherentTwist.lean#L213-L217","doc":"Same for the two `ν` forms: `{−1,0,1}` and `{0,0,0}` share a ribbon weight,\nand the reduced one is `{0,0,0}` — independently the answer\n`ComponentFraming.nu_framing_is_zero` derives from \"leptons are knots\". ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.d_forms_same_weight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.d_forms_same_weight","kind":"theorem","line":205,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/SignCoherentTwist.lean#L205-L211","doc":"**The excluded and kept `d` forms carry the same ribbon weight.**\n\nWith `θ` central the weight of a framing is `θ ^ total`, so `{−1,−1,1}` and\n`{−1,0,0}` are indistinguishable to the twist — the choice between them is a\nchoice of representative, and sign-coherence picks the reduced one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.coherent_iff_all_same_sign","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.coherent_iff_all_same_sign","kind":"theorem","line":188,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/SignCoherentTwist.lean#L188-L203","doc":"**Sign-coherence is exactly \"all non-negative or all non-positive\".** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.nu_mixed_sign_not_coherent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.nu_mixed_sign_not_coherent","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/SignCoherentTwist.lean#L149-L153","doc":"And the `ν`-survivor sign-coherence kills: `{−1,0,1}` carries both signs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.nu_survivor_coherent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.nu_survivor_coherent","kind":"theorem","line":142,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/SignCoherentTwist.lean#L142-L147","doc":"`ν = {0,0,0}` survives sign-coherence — the same answer\n`ComponentFraming.nu_framing_is_zero` derives from \"leptons are knots\". Two\nindependent routes, one derived and one assumed, agreeing. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.e_survivor_coherent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.e_survivor_coherent","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/SignCoherentTwist.lean#L137-L140","doc":"`e = {−1,−1,−1}` survives sign-coherence. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.u_survivor_coherent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.u_survivor_coherent","kind":"theorem","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/SignCoherentTwist.lean#L132-L135","doc":"`u = {0,1,1}` survives sign-coherence. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.d_survivor_coherent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.d_survivor_coherent","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/SignCoherentTwist.lean#L122-L125","doc":"The surviving `d`-assignment **is** sign-coherent. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.d_mixed_sign_not_coherent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.d_mixed_sign_not_coherent","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/SignCoherentTwist.lean#L116-L120","doc":"The excluded `d`-survivor, named: `{−1,−1,1}` is **not** sign-coherent. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.d_multiset_forced","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.d_multiset_forced","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/SignCoherentTwist.lean#L95-L114","doc":"**`d = {−1,0,0}` is forced.**\n\nWith entries in `{−1,0,1}`, total `−1`, and sign-coherence, the twist datum is\n`{−1,0,0}` in one of its three orderings — so `{−1,−1,1}` is excluded and `d`'s\nambiguity is closed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.no_positive_of_negative_total","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.no_positive_of_negative_total","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/SignCoherentTwist.lean#L74-L93","doc":"Sign-coherence plus a **negative** total forbids any positive strand.\n\nThis is the whole mechanism: `{−1,−1,1}` dies because it carries a `+1` while\nits total is `−1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.SignCoherent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.SignCoherentTwist.SignCoherent","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/SignCoherentTwist.lean#L70-L72","doc":"**Sign-coherence**: no two strands carry twists of opposite sign. ","signatureChunk":0}]}